    {
      "id": "uRUBL95BZ52GT_I0S85CA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12077.30229263261,
      "y": 10163.8666534013,
      "width": 985.9637451171875,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 813719016,
      "version": 86,
      "versionNonce": 1770382824,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783866377699,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Best Sol: Cache maxBid in Auction Table\nWe can solve this as\n- Lock the auction row for the given auction (just one row)\n- Read the max bid for the given auction from the Auction table.\n- Write the bid to the database with a status of accepted or rejected.\n- Update the max bid in the Auction table if the new bid is higher.\n- Commit the transaction.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Best Sol: Cache maxBid in Auction Table\nWe can solve this as\n- Lock the auction row for the given auction (just one row)\n- Read the max bid for the given auction from the Auction table.\n- Write the bid to the database with a status of accepted or rejected.\n- Update the max bid in the Auction table if the new bid is higher.\n- Commit the transaction.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_kQYAmIsYNdaBn4afj8Ky",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12074.766030423682,
      "y": 10442.855496383836,
      "width": 1313.423583984375,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1398376088,
      "version": 153,
      "versionNonce": 681164440,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783866429940,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- We now only lock a single row for short duration.\n- Optimistic Concurrency Control is ideal for our system because bid conflicts are relatively rare.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- We now only lock a single row for short duration.\n- Optimistic Concurrency Control is ideal for our system because bid conflicts are relatively rare.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "18H8EXfV8GalV-3xAnWkt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12096.77999381527,
      "y": 10762.612772920116,
      "width": 779.0715942382812,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2001641448,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 1749548952,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783866550338,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UPDATE auctions \nSET max_bid = :new_bid \nWHERE id = :auction_id AND max_bid = :original_max_bid",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UPDATE auctions \nSET max_bid = :new_bid \nWHERE id = :auction_id AND max_bid = :original_max_bid",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DHprvIIH2k5Yo07UOuZad",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12090.39569959796,
      "y": 10558.420096884498,
      "width": 1320.063148025367,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2001530344,
      "version": 217,
      "versionNonce": 1017317528,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783866508427,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Read the auction row and get the current max bid (this is what is referred to as the\n'version' with OCC)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Read the auction row and get the current max bid (this is what is referred to as the 'version' with OCC)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wHaBxsUR-V2Hvks1-0r74",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12090.466947281571,
      "y": 10647.241324638308,
      "width": 761.82373046875,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 581911704,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 1008904344,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783866511086,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Validate that the new bid is higher than the max bid",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Validate that the new bid is higher than the max bid",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "81v2Lo8a7srIsqzSkO18R",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12094.143286532864,
      "y": 10692.534789197845,
      "width": 1057.5349203183252,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 373747944,
      "version": 252,
      "versionNonce": 1622684568,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783866530869,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Try to update the auction row, but only if the max bid hasn't changed",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Try to update the auction row, but only if the max bid hasn't changed",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vGimJuWE2I7-aXu21s8_I",
