    },
    {
      "id": "m-r69pfawQTSNbT5mbwc8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12095.347496325834,
      "y": 11148.482940270931,
      "width": 1782.507080078125,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1481588712,
      "version": 227,
      "versionNonce": 1200064232,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783866863028,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Benefits:\n- Durable Storage (if Bid Service, crashes, bid is safely stored and won't be lost)\n- Buffering against Load spikes\n- Ordering within an auction\n    - Kafka guarantees message ordering within a single partition. By partitioning our topic by auctionId, all bids for the same \n      auction land on the same partition and are processed in the order they were received. This is important for fairness - if two\n      users bid the same amount, we want to ensure the first bid wins. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Benefits:\n- Durable Storage (if Bid Service, crashes, bid is safely stored and won't be lost)\n- Buffering against Load spikes\n- Ordering within an auction\n    - Kafka guarantees message ordering within a single partition. By partitioning our topic by auctionId, all bids for the same \n      auction land on the same partition and are processed in the order they were received. This is important for fairness - if two\n      users bid the same amount, we want to ensure the first bid wins. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
