    {
      "id": "ZLTUELNeEqEW7FT6ywR4b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12136.35930016778,
      "y": 12149.687526687265,
      "width": 1019.7036743164062,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 233710824,
      "version": 226,
      "versionNonce": 1028172520,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867107499,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kafka:\n 1) High throughput: Can handle million of msgs per second.\n 2) Durability: Persist all msg to disk and can be configured for replication\n 3) Paritioning",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kafka:\n 1) High throughput: Can handle million of msgs per second.\n 2) Durability: Persist all msg to disk and can be configured for replication\n 3) Paritioning",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p43cSx8AhNfjfqZQGTQ6c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12027.689704109162,
      "y": 12418.006898181024,
      "width": 1146.4876708984375,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 678223512,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1191712920,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867125887,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) How can we ensure that the system displays the current highest bid in real-time?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) How can we ensure that the system displays the current highest bid in real-time?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WaGPWx3SupaHflLfPx4WS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12081.204855826281,
      "y": 12462.636178787225,
      "width": 447.41192626953125,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b40",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1018366952,
      "version": 69,
      "versionNonce": 940391064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867251115,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Good Sol: Long Polling\n- Better Sol: Server Sent events",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Good Sol: Long Polling\n- Better Sol: Server Sent events",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xyIQAXBFw5CF7eVxxnfam",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12103.397012592459,
      "y": 12555.050240948116,
      "width": 1336.6634521484375,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b41",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1014392984,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 195819416,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867285633,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- SSE establishes a unidirectional channel from server to client, allowing the server to push \n updates whenever they occur without requiring the client to poll or maintain multiple connections.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- SSE establishes a unidirectional channel from server to client, allowing the server to push \n updates whenever they occur without requiring the client to poll or maintain multiple connections.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AKE7yoo0sT8MUdgeuLUdY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12106.619980945645,
      "y": 12650.527225652908,
      "width": 1122.491455078125,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b42",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2065917336,
      "version": 20,
      "versionNonce": 55359720,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867311757,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client Side impl\nconst eventSource = new EventSource(`/api/auctions/${auctionId}/bid-stream`);\n\neventSource.onmessage = (event) => {\n  const { maxBid } = JSON.parse(event.data);\n  updateUI(maxBid);\n};",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client Side impl\nconst eventSource = new EventSource(`/api/auctions/${auctionId}/bid-stream`);\n\neventSource.onmessage = (event) => {\n  const { maxBid } = JSON.parse(event.data);\n  updateUI(maxBid);\n};",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
