      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sse connection for maxbid updates",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "VEThlS-1yMInhc1hj6Jtp",
      "originalText": "sse connection for maxbid updates",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qHzX4YLu5oy9wjvy_vFVn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12038.027049262784,
      "y": 14667.688717248884,
      "width": 1485.6513671875,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2077380584,
      "version": 21,
      "versionNonce": 1547709848,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867528710,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Challenge:\nIf User 1 is connected to Server A and User 2 to Server B, a bid received by Server A updates only User 1. \nWithout server-to-server synchronization, User 2 remains with stale data.\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Challenge:\nIf User 1 is connected to Server A and User 2 to Server B, a bid received by Server A updates only User 1. \nWithout server-to-server synchronization, User 2 remains with stale data.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "K_Vo_yFKiFV0MlGb_PG2b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12040.898663240847,
      "y": 14830.633482101857,
      "width": 282.46392822265625,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1501081240,
      "version": 23,
      "versionNonce": 908527080,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867561787,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We can use Pub/Sub.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We can use Pub/Sub.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Mr649XKN04SmfrRgxaQ58",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12053.255942483522,
      "y": 14882.103080185107,
      "width": 1843.9388427734375,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 55169944,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 1465878680,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867612018,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "when Server A receives a new bid, it publishes that bid to the pub/sub system, essentially putting it on a queue. \nAll other instances of the Bid Service are subscribed to the same pub/sub channel and receive the message. \nIf the bid is for an auction that one of their current client connections is subscribed to, they send that connection the new bid data",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "when Server A receives a new bid, it publishes that bid to the pub/sub system, essentially putting it on a queue. \nAll other instances of the Bid Service are subscribed to the same pub/sub channel and receive the message. \nIf the bid is for an auction that one of their current client connections is subscribed to, they send that connection the new bid data",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
