      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783867939217,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4) How can we ensure that the system scales to support 10M concurrent auctions?\n- For writres, We can shard DB by auctionId, so that we can spread write load across multiple instances\n- Bid Service: Auto Scaling\n- Message Queue",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4) How can we ensure that the system scales to support 10M concurrent auctions?\n- For writres, We can shard DB by auctionId, so that we can spread write load across multiple instances\n- Bid Service: Auto Scaling\n- Message Queue",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6G439iLUWdWVaZkaldyLX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12056.440926441874,
      "y": 15112.469216696794,
      "width": 975.7039879019517,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
